WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.840
Good morning John!

00:00:00.840 --> 00:00:02.100
I don't even know if you knew this about me

00:00:02.100 --> 00:00:03.300
but I have a condition

00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:04.820
It's called sleep paralysis

00:00:04.820 --> 00:00:07.400
It's very common, and it's when you wake up and you can't move

00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:10.160
This usually happens after I've had a particularly intense dream

00:00:10.160 --> 00:00:12.340
and it's only ever a couple of seconds for me

00:00:12.340 --> 00:00:15.400
And I woke up in the middle of the night last night after having a dream

00:00:15.400 --> 00:00:17.620
in which Katherine got double pregnant

00:00:17.620 --> 00:00:20.120
I don't know if you know about double pregnancy but according to my dream

00:00:20.120 --> 00:00:24.880
anyway, it's where a woman who is already pregnant, gets pregnant again

00:00:24.880 --> 00:00:27.300
And then there's two babies; there's an older one and a younger one

00:00:27.300 --> 00:00:29.820
and the woman has the first baby and the other one sticks around

00:00:29.820 --> 00:00:31.300
and she's still pregnant for even longer

00:00:31.300 --> 00:00:33.000
which I assume is an anxiety dream

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:35.380
but it does actually make me wanna check something out real quick here

00:00:47.320 --> 00:00:48.300
ahhhhhh

00:00:49.420 --> 00:00:50.280
You can!

00:00:50.280 --> 00:00:51.900
It's a real th- it exists!

00:00:51.900 --> 00:00:54.060
I thought I was making a joke, you guys

00:00:54.060 --> 00:00:58.540
It's called superfetation and it's when your body accidentally releases another egg

00:00:58.540 --> 00:01:01.160
and then that egg gets fertilized and if it's early enough in the pregnancy

00:01:01.160 --> 00:01:02.600
BOTH OF THE EGGS CAN BECOME BABIES

00:01:02.600 --> 00:01:06.200
Born at the same time, but different ages gestationally

00:01:06.200 --> 00:01:07.060
What?? What??

00:01:07.060 --> 00:01:08.340
Aw man, double pregnant

00:01:08.340 --> 00:01:09.060
But anyway

00:01:09.060 --> 00:01:10.760
So I wake up from this dream, I can't move

00:01:10.760 --> 00:01:13.520
I'm a little bit confused about where exactly I am 'cause I'm on the wrong side of the bed

00:01:13.520 --> 00:01:14.520
But then my movement comes back

00:01:14.520 --> 00:01:18.280
except for the first time in my life,  one arm, my right arm

00:01:18.280 --> 00:01:19.380
does not come back

00:01:19.380 --> 00:01:22.380
And this does not mesh with what I understand about sleep paralysis

00:01:22.380 --> 00:01:23.340
I'm a little bit freakin' out

00:01:23.340 --> 00:01:24.800
And I reach over to see

00:01:24.800 --> 00:01:25.720
and here's what's happened

00:01:25.720 --> 00:01:28.780
During my weird double pregnancy dream, I have done this

00:01:28.780 --> 00:01:32.080
Just shoved my arm down my pants (laughing)

00:01:32.080 --> 00:01:33.320
So that's why I couldn't move it

00:01:33.320 --> 00:01:34.180
It was stuck in my pants

00:01:34.180 --> 00:01:34.900
New topic now

00:01:34.900 --> 00:01:37.320
As I was reading the comments on your most recent video

00:01:37.320 --> 00:01:39.460
I, I noticed, I had a couple of thoughts

00:01:39.460 --> 00:01:42.140
First, yeah, uh, our outfits

00:01:42.140 --> 00:01:44.320
So you may have noticed, you may not have

00:01:44.320 --> 00:01:48.260
that, uh, for two weeks in a row John and I wore the same outfits

00:01:48.260 --> 00:01:51.120
not as each other, like, ya know the thing when you go to work the next morning and you're like

00:01:51.120 --> 00:01:53.060
"Oh I wore this yesterday didn't I"

00:01:53.060 --> 00:01:54.460
"That's embarassing"

00:01:54.460 --> 00:01:57.160
Except, of course, with 250,000 people watching

00:01:57.160 --> 00:01:59.560
There were conspiracy theories about this

00:01:59.560 --> 00:02:02.500
that John and I had both pre-taped videos

00:02:02.500 --> 00:02:06.440
uh, and now we're off on some secret adventure thing

00:02:06.440 --> 00:02:10.360
No, in fact, and now it is the third week of us wearing the same outfits

00:02:10.360 --> 00:02:13.760
The first two weeks, actually this is the case, though it seems unlikely

00:02:13.760 --> 00:02:14.900
We did not do that on purpose

00:02:14.900 --> 00:02:17.120
John wore the same shirt two videos in a row

00:02:17.120 --> 00:02:19.980
I wore the same shirt and jacket two videos in a row

00:02:19.980 --> 00:02:23.360
This week, uh, we did it just to continue messing with you

00:02:23.700 --> 00:02:25.100
So, sorry about that

00:02:25.100 --> 00:02:27.160
Another thing I was really struck by in the comments of your video

00:02:27.160 --> 00:02:30.400
is how many people don't know about all the stuff that we do

00:02:30.400 --> 00:02:33.700
And of course, because we've done a lot of things over the last 10 years

00:02:33.700 --> 00:02:35.840
And we are currently doing a lot of things

00:02:35.840 --> 00:02:38.760
We've got VidCon in Europe, Australia, And California coming up

00:02:38.760 --> 00:02:42.200
We're working on a new SciShow channel with a topic to be chosen by Patreon patrons

00:02:42.200 --> 00:02:44.760
A tenth anniversary NerdCon: Nerdfigheria to plan

00:02:44.760 --> 00:02:47.380
A wife to kill, and Guilder to frame for it

00:02:47.740 --> 00:02:50.420
Not actually killing my wife, that was a Princess Bride reference

00:02:50.420 --> 00:02:52.480
Building How to Vote, continuing Dear Hank and John

00:02:52.480 --> 00:02:55.560
occasionally Snapchatting, helping found the Internet Creators Guild

00:02:55.560 --> 00:03:00.520
which has done a great job of explaining why the demonetization thing isn't the end of YouTube

00:03:00.520 --> 00:03:01.920
isn't the end of everything

00:03:01.920 --> 00:03:03.680
If you wanna read about that there's a link in the description

00:03:03.680 --> 00:03:06.880
It reminds me, as I tend to be reminded about once a year

00:03:07.220 --> 00:03:11.460
that I don't always understand this community as well as I could

00:03:11.460 --> 00:03:16.040
And the first time I realized that is when we created the first Nerdfighteria Census in 2013

00:03:16.040 --> 00:03:19.520
And I realise now that maybe I'm having this sensation because it's been another year

00:03:19.520 --> 00:03:22.160
since there's been a Census and I haven't done another one and so

00:03:22.160 --> 00:03:23.680
Yes! It is time!

00:03:23.680 --> 00:03:28.380
I spent the five hours before recording this video putting together the Nerdfighteria Census for 2016

00:03:28.380 --> 00:03:30.440
It's a pretty involved survey, there are lots of questions

00:03:30.440 --> 00:03:34.280
We want to get a really good, deep understanding of the people in this community

00:03:34.280 --> 00:03:37.000
so that we know better what to create, what you want from us

00:03:37.000 --> 00:03:38.520
and what we should do together

00:03:38.520 --> 00:03:41.700
It's hugely important to me and to John, and it's very important for this community

00:03:41.700 --> 00:03:44.860
If you have the time to go take the Census, please please do

00:03:44.860 --> 00:03:46.240
It's much appreciated

00:03:46.240 --> 00:03:48.160
John, I'll see you on Tuesday

00:03:48.420 --> 00:03:51.000
♫ Double, the pregnant, double the fun! ♫

00:03:51.000 --> 00:03:53.640
♫ Link to the Census in the description! ♫

